        },
        {
          "text": "Man nindo m’ecamu ie ker wi Israel en e rundi pier ang’wen; ecamu ker rundi abiro i Hebron, man rundi pier adek wi adek ecamu ker i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
