          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etho i tio ma ber, m’epong’ ku ceng’, ku lonyo, man yung: man Suleman ma wode camu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
