              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie tic pa Daudi m’ubimo, ma kwong’ane man ma cenne gigore i lemkei pa Samwil ma jaeulembe, man i lemkei pa Nathan ma jabila, man i lemkei pa Gad ma jaeulembe, ",
          "type": "text",
